---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About the Project | BitsNotes" 
  description="The story behind BitsNotes — from personal study notes to a notes sharing platform for everyone."
  keywords="about bitsnotes, lecture notes project, free study materials, educational platform"
  robots="index, follow"
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "AboutPage",
      "name": "The Story of BitsNotes",
      "description": "From personal study notes to a dedicated lecture notes sharing platform.",
      "url": "https://bitsnotes.com/about"
    })} />
  </Fragment>

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16 flex-grow">
    <header class="mb-10">
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[var(--text)] tracking-tight leading-tight">
        How BitsNotes Came to Be
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[var(--text-muted)] text-lg">
        One student&rsquo;s struggle became a resource for many.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-8">
      <section class="space-y-4 text-[var(--text)] leading-relaxed">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--text)]">The Problem</h2>
        <p>
          I don’t enjoy reading long educational content, especially when studying. When I started my AI and ML course, I found it difficult to use multiple sources to understand a single topic, and each additional source added only marginal value.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--text)] pt-4">A Personal Solution</h2>
        <p>
          So, I decided to create comprehensive notes for myself, using my lecture notes as a base and enriching them with what I learned from different reference materials and study guides. It worked pretty well for me.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--text)] pt-4">Sharing the Discovery</h2>
        <p>
          But these notes stayed with me offline. As I discussed them with my teammates and fellow students, I found that they faced similar issues and were interested in the notes.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--text)] pt-4">The Birth of BitsNotes</h2>
        <p>
          So, I started bitsnotes.com as a notes sharing platform with a simple notes parser. With feedback and support, I've improved on the website to create this platform that I am proud of.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--text)] pt-4">The Vision Ahead</h2>
        <p>
          I wish to continue improving and add more subjects where possible to expand the selection of study resources available.
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-6 border-t border-[var(--border)]">
        <div class="p-5 border border-[var(--border)] rounded-[var(--r-md)]">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-[var(--r-sm)] bg-[var(--accent-subtle)] flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--accent)] mb-3">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-[var(--text)]">Blazing Fast</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)] mt-1 leading-relaxed">Powered by edge workers and R2 for rapid page rendering.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 border border-[var(--border)] rounded-[var(--r-md)]">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-[var(--r-sm)] bg-[var(--accent-subtle)] flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--accent)] mb-3">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-[var(--text)]">Study Aids</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)] mt-1 leading-relaxed">Integrated core concepts, breakdowns, and practice quizzes on pages.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
